    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kombi",
    "steam_appid": 3492330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kombi is a fun, minimalist, grid-based puzzle game. The aim of the game is to move tiles across the board, picking up points along the way, in order to end up with a single tile with a value that matches the number of the target tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/b7661ba29870cb5e473b06a984563fd3.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it starts off simple, the later campaign levels introduce enough complexity to keep you entertained and scratching your head for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/a1f8dc3cfebc238e308c550ebc1cb1f0.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you've completed the campaign levels, you are free to enjoy an unlimited selection of custom levels, allowing you to play the game indefinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/decbde97a0056d00ab4ad4a50e4527b9.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no limitations or locked levels, each level can be completed in any number of turns, though there is a special completion badge awarded if a level is completed within a certain number of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/2d4d4d8e333fba41f96f462730c3048c.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 campaign levels of various grid sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom level generator allowing you to choose any difficulty you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing background music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited UNDO options if you make a mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different themes, including dark mode</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kombi is a fun, minimalist, grid-based puzzle game. The aim of the game is to move tiles across the board, picking up points along the way, in order to end up with a single tile with a value that matches the number of the target tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/b7661ba29870cb5e473b06a984563fd3.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it starts off simple, the later campaign levels introduce enough complexity to keep you entertained and scratching your head for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/a1f8dc3cfebc238e308c550ebc1cb1f0.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you've completed the campaign levels, you are free to enjoy an unlimited selection of custom levels, allowing you to play the game indefinitely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/decbde97a0056d00ab4ad4a50e4527b9.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no limitations or locked levels, each level can be completed in any number of turns, though there is a special completion badge awarded if a level is completed within a certain number of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492330/extras/2d4d4d8e333fba41f96f462730c3048c.avif?t=1741765958\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 campaign levels of various grid sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A custom level generator allowing you to choose any difficulty you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing background music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited UNDO options if you make a mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different themes, including dark mode</p></li></ul>",
